        <div id="price-history" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>What XTERRA Treadmills Have Sold For</h2>
<p>
            XTERRA’s prices have moved in both directions this month. Between our first check on 5 November and
            28 November, every Compact and WalkSlim model and the TR75H came down by $50 to $300, while the three
            Sport-series runners went up by $100. The prices recorded on our XTERRA pages are a better guide to a
            fair price than XTERRA’s regular-price figures.
          </p>
          <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto my-8"><table class="min-w-[600px] w-full text-sm border-collapse">
            <thead><tr><th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Model</th><th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Earlier prices we recorded</th><th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">28 Nov 2026</th></tr></thead>
