            your serial number”, and its FAQ says the app is not required: every machine works from its console.
            Bluetooth models pair with third-party apps such as Zwift and Kinomap, whose subscriptions are not
            included, per XTERRA. So the five-year cost is close to the purchase price. The table uses 28 November
            prices, assumes no paid app, no shipping charge and no repairs, and divides over five years.
